    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[FATAL RESEARCH]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rail shooting FPS game based on the SCP universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is a mobile task force member of SCP and receives a unique mission for each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Stage 1]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter to carry out the [Full Eradication Order] after receiving news that the research team that went to investigate the strange phenomenon that appeared in an abandoned hospital was completely destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the cause by dealing with the victims and the research team who were turned into [mannequins] by an unknown monster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Stage 2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dispatched into space to investigate the [Space Base] that appeared in Earth's orbit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, inside, aliens were already waging war with SCP...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A desperate chase to carry out the [Quick Search and Escape Order]!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Stage 3]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tunnel in a certain mountain in Japan. If left unattended, it would cause numerous casualties and contamination, so the Foundation was conducting [Regular Eradication Containment] to prevent escape to the outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the player assigned to this [Periodic Purge Quarantine] be able to complete the task safely?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[FATAL RESEARCH]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rail shooting FPS game based on the SCP universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is a mobile task force member of SCP and receives a unique mission for each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Stage 1]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter to carry out the [Full Eradication Order] after receiving news that the research team that went to investigate the strange phenomenon that appeared in an abandoned hospital was completely destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the cause by dealing with the victims and the research team who were turned into [mannequins] by an unknown monster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Stage 2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dispatched into space to investigate the [Space Base] that appeared in Earth's orbit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, inside, aliens were already waging war with SCP...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A desperate chase to carry out the [Quick Search and Escape Order]!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Stage 3]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tunnel in a certain mountain in Japan. If left unattended, it would cause numerous casualties and contamination, so the Foundation was conducting [Regular Eradication Containment] to prevent escape to the outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the player assigned to this [Periodic Purge Quarantine] be able to complete the task safely?</p>",
    "short_description": "[FATAL RESEARCH] is an arcade rail shooting FPS game set in the SCP world. You can enjoy three types of play: exploration, chase, and defense.",
